            "title": "Ripples and Resonance #2",
            "image_prompt": "calm lake surface at dawn, soft reflections",
            "caption_prompt": "Reflect on ripples and resonance. What does it teach us about productive failure? #TheNineStitches",
            "id": 140
        },
        "platforms": [
            "instagram",
            "linkedin",
